ideo Output: </strong>Mini HDMI</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>Audio Output: </strong>Mini HDMI</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>USB ports: </strong>1 x USB 2.0 OTG</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>Camera interface: </strong>CSI</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>GPIO: </strong>GPIO (x28)<strong> </strong>Power (+5V, +3.3V and GND)<strong> </strong>UART, I2C, SPI or PWM</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>Power Input: </strong>Micro USB with 5V/2A or PoE power</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>Size&amp;Weight: </strong>65mm X 52.5mm, 30g</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>OS: </strong>Android and Linux</span></span></p>\r\n', 12, 'Yes', '2021-06-08', '<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\">Allwinner H2+, Quad-core Cortex-A7</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\">Mali 400 MP2</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\">512MB DDR 3 SDRAM</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"