utput: </strong>HDMI port and multi-channel audio output<strong> </strong>LVDS</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>Audio Output: </strong>3.5mm jack and HDMI</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>USB ports: </strong>2 x USB 2.0 ports</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>GPIO: </strong>GPIO (x28)<strong> </strong>Power (+5V, +3.3V and GND)<strong> </strong>UART, I2C, SPI or PWM</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>Power Input: </strong>5V/2A via Micro USB</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>Size&amp;Weight: </strong>92x60mm, 48g</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\"><strong>OS: </strong>Android and Linux</span></span></p>\r\n', 13, 'Yes', '2021-06-08', '<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\">Allwinner A20 Dual-core 1.0GHz</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\">Mali-400 MP2 with Open GL ES 2.0/1.1</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\">1 GB DDR3 memory</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\">Wifi supported onboard</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif\">SA